{"id":41646,"ord":51,"n_segments":144,"prev":41645,"next":41647,"doc":{"id":"52031","title":"52031_Kenny Clarke oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Kenny Clarke","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/52031/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=52031"},"chapter":"Edgar Hayes and Teddy Hill","title":"Teddy Hill at the 1939 World's Fair and Savoy Pavilion","category":"band_or_employer","summary":"About a year and a half with the band, including the 1939 World's Fair, doing 16 appearances a day featuring Lindy Hoppers.","period":"1939","year_from":1939,"year_to":1939,"words":147,"start":[94,0],"end":[95,3],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=52031#s41646","tags":{"places":[{"name":"New York","focus":0,"type":"city"}],"venues":[{"name":"1939 New York World's Fair","focus":1,"city":"New York"},{"name":"Savoy Pavilion","focus":1,"city":"New York"}],"bands":[{"name":"Teddy Hill Orchestra","focus":1,"leader":"Teddy Hill"},{"name":"Chick Webb Orchestra","focus":0,"leader":"Chick Webb"}]},"people":[{"name":"Chick Webb","qid":"Q505749","n":1},{"name":"Benny Goodman","qid":"Q46755","n":1}],"story":{"theme":18,"theme_name":"Getting paid: wages, tips and leaving over money","community":39,"community_name":"Battling at the Savoy Ballroom","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":94,"b":0,"s":"MS.","x":"How long were you in the band?"},{"p":94,"b":1,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"Oh, let's see. We played the World's Fair with the band, too, in '39. So I was with the band about a year and a half. We did the whole 1939 World's Fair."},{"p":94,"b":2,"s":"MS.","x":"No kidding."},{"p":94,"b":3,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"Then went to the Savoy Pavillon."},{"p":94,"b":4,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah."},{"p":94,"b":5,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"With Chick Webb."},{"p":94,"b":6,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah."},{"p":94,"b":7,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"And the Lindy Hoppers and all them."},{"p":94,"b":8,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah."},{"p":94,"b":9,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"We did the whole fair."},{"p":94,"b":10,"s":"MS.","x":"Down there at -- down the throughway and all that?"},{"p":94,"b":11,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"Yeah, the throughway."},{"p":94,"b":12,"s":"MS.","x":"Wasn't that called Freedomland?"},{"p":94,"b":13,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"Yeah. Almost at the end they had the Savoy Pavillion."},{"p":94,"b":14,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah."},{"p":94,"b":15,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"So we used to do 16 appearances a day."},{"p":94,"b":16,"s":"MS.","x":"And they had bands featured as well."},{"p":94,"b":17,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":94,"b":18,"s":"MS.","x":"They had two places for bands."},{"p":94,"b":19,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"Yeah, that's right."},{"p":94,"b":20,"s":"MS.","x":"Because I remember Benny Goodman"},{"p":95,"b":0,"s":"MS.","x":"telling me he was down there."},{"p":95,"b":1,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"So we were mostly featured with the Lindy Hoppers."},{"p":95,"b":2,"s":"MS.","x":"Yeah."},{"p":95,"b":3,"s":"MR. CLARKE","x":"That was the big thing then."}]}